# Build-process memos — kept locally, never published.
# These are the working instructions used to construct the project (phase
# sequencing, model routing, distribution plan). They are not project doctrine
# and not a deliverable: the public story is told by README.md, docs/ and
# .claude/benacta/. Publishing an operating manual for how the repository was
# produced would say nothing about the architecture and a great deal about the
# process.
00_START_HERE_BENACTA.md
01_MASTER_BRIEF_BENACTA.md
02_EXECUTION_PLAYBOOK.md

# Local environment overrides
.env.local
.env.*
!.env.example
